      "sourceTextSha256": "ea099b2cfc9e6c299f8f2cb561de7d86e63f3447054940a0f6f7008f17d30c65",
      "text": "Saco de Mamanguá is a hidden gem that offers a peaceful escape into nature. Its unique combination of forested mountains, clear waters, and traditional communities makes it a special destination for those looking to explore Brazil's natural and cultural heritage.  It is often referred to as Brazil's only tropical fjord, though technically it is a ria—a coastal inlet formed by the partial submergence of a river valley. The amazing beaches of Saco de Mamangua have served as filming locations for movies of Twilight and many more. Enjoy a tropical escape on this hidden gem's beaches and inlets.  ",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1-58PjXNqY64Za9uRWGVyg-fXi4BVbva0",
